{
  "name": "@cskwork/pi-symphony",
  "version": "1.0.1",
  "description": "Symphony for Pi \u2014 production-ready evidence-based software-development workflow: Plan \u2192 Build \u2192 Review \u2192 Verify \u2192 Ready \u2192 Done with durable evidence, independent review, controlled delivery, delegation, scheduling, and a synchronized local web UI.",
